# Rust
target/
# A library: consumers pick their own versions. (Inline comments are NOT
# stripped by gitignore — a trailing "# ..." here would become part of the
# literal pattern and silently fail to match. Verified 2026-08-18 while
# building SPEC-001: the previous same-line comment left Cargo.lock untracked
# instead of ignored, the first time this repo ever generated one.)
Cargo.lock
**/*.rs.bk

# RAW corpus — tier B is NEVER committed (docs/conformance-matrix.md).
# Real camera files are 30-60 MB and copyrighted by whoever shot them.
tests/corpus/tier-b/
*.DNG
*.dng
*.NEF
*.nef
*.NRW
*.nrw
*.RAF
*.raf
*.CR2
*.cr2
*.ARW
*.arw
# PEF was missing here while tests/corpus/manifest.toml already indexed a
# 37 MB K3III.PEF — added 2026-08-20 (SPEC-003).
*.PEF
*.pef

# Private commercial / positioning notes (crustyimg's `business/` precedent)
business/
